# Claude working files -- session prompts, analyses, handoff notes.
# Both spellings on purpose: the folder on disk is Claude_files/, and the
# lowercase pattern only matches it on case-insensitive filesystems
# (Windows). Spelled out so a Linux/WSL/CI checkout ignores it too.
claude_files/
Claude_files/
claude.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
*.md
